    <summary>xdsk - Modern DSK image manipulation tool for Amstrad CPC</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
# xdsk

A modern, fast, and user-friendly command-line tool for working with Amstrad CPC DSK disk images.

## Features

- **List** files in a DSK image (table, JSON, CSV, simple formats)
- **Import** files into DSK images with AMSDOS header support
- **Export** files from DSK images with optional header stripping
- **Remove** files from DSK images (with wildcard support)
- **Create** new blank DSK images
- **View** file contents: BASIC listing, hex dump, ASCII, Z80 disassembly
- **Shell completions** for bash, zsh and fish
- **Man pages** auto-generated from the binary

## Usage

```
xdsk create game.dsk
xdsk import game.dsk LOADER.BIN --file-type binary --load 0x4000 --exec 0x4000
xdsk list game.dsk
xdsk export game.dsk LOADER.BIN --output ./extracted/
xdsk remove game.dsk LOADER.BIN --force
```

## Aliases

Every subcommand has a short alias: `ls`, `add`, `get`, `rm`, `new`.
    ]]></description>
